        "type": "game",
        "name": "みんなで Physical TRAIN ～チャムランド国営鉄道～",
        "steam_appid": 3897310,
        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run trains freely in a model railway-style diorama world -- a physics-based digital railway diorama.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operate and watch trains run across open railway lines featuring a variety of environments such as mountain routes, cities, and harbors, and enjoy the world of railways from different perspectives.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Physics-Based Train Movement</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trains in this game do not simply follow predetermined paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead, wheels actually rotate and roll along the rails, allowing trains to move through the world using a physics-based system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train behavior changes depending on factors such as speed and weight, creating dynamic and engaging train movement.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ A Model Railway-Inspired Diorama World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Railway lines pass through a variety of landscapes including mountains, cities, and ports.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can enjoy watching trains run through these environments from multiple viewpoints.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the charm of a model railway layout brought to life in a digital world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ The Chamland Republic and Its Missions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game takes place in the Chamland Republic, a newly developing city-state located in a mountainous region.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a railway operator, you will complete various missions and contribute to the growth and development of the country.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ A Light Cooperative System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players are loosely connected through a contribution system and can work together toward shared goals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the world and help expand the railway network.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run trains freely in a model railway-style diorama world -- a physics-based digital railway diorama.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operate and watch trains run across open railway lines featuring a variety of environments such as mountain routes, cities, and harbors, and enjoy the world of railways from different perspectives.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Physics-Based Train Movement</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trains in this game do not simply follow predetermined paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead, wheels actually rotate and roll along the rails, allowing trains to move through the world using a physics-based system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train behavior changes depending on factors such as speed and weight, creating dynamic and engaging train movement.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ A Model Railway-Inspired Diorama World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Railway lines pass through a variety of landscapes including mountains, cities, and ports.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can enjoy watching trains run through these environments from multiple viewpoints.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the charm of a model railway layout brought to life in a digital world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ The Chamland Republic and Its Missions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game takes place in the Chamland Republic, a newly developing city-state located in a mountainous region.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a railway operator, you will complete various missions and contribute to the growth and development of the country.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ A Light Cooperative System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players are loosely connected through a contribution system and can work together toward shared goals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the world and help expand the railway network.</p>",
        "short_description": "A physics-based railway game where you can freely run trains in a diorama world inspired by digital model railways.",
